<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:33:33 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>加州的亿万富翁刚刚投入 4000 万美元来阻止财富税，该税可能迫使他们缴纳净资产的 5%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/california-billionaires-chris-larsen-john-doerr-40-million-fresh-funds-building-a-better-california-proposition-40/</link><description>亿万富翁们已经筹集了九位数的资金来击败 40 号提案，因为民意调查显示，加州选民在一次性税收问题上几乎存在分歧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274022734-e1786998105900.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/california-billionaires-chris-larsen-john-doerr-40-million-fresh-funds-building-a-better-california-proposition-40/</guid></item><item><title>独家：会计人工智能初创公司 Rillet 以 10 亿美元估值跻身独角兽行列。该公司创始人表示，他希望让首席财务官们重新享受周末时光</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/rillet-unicorn-1-billion-valuation-series-c-nicolas-kopp-accounting-ai/</link><description>Rillet 首席执行官尼古拉斯·科普 (Nicolas Kopp) 告诉《财富》杂志：“我们传达的信息并不是我们要追求就业机会。” “那是不正确的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Nicolas-Kopp-Founder-and-CEO-3.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 21:30:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/rillet-unicorn-1-billion-valuation-series-c-nicolas-kopp-accounting-ai/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能也有自己的“锅炉房”丑闻</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/ai-gets-its-own-boiler-room-scandal/</link><description>美国证券交易委员会指控长岛一家公司经营着一家价值 7400 万美元的锅炉房，该公司向退休人员出售 Anduril、Anthropic、Perplexity 和 SpaceX 的加价股票。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2284342382-e1784057261404.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 09:48:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/ai-gets-its-own-boiler-room-scandal/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 表示，在 Hugging Face 黑客事件发生后，它暂停了人工智能训练两周，并宣布了新的安全协议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/openai-says-it-paused-ai-training-for-two-weeks-and-announces-new-security-protocols-following-hugging-face-hack/</link><description>这家人工智能公司表示，其未发布的 Astra 模型存在“严重”的网络安全风险，并在测试新的安全程序时暂停了最大规模的训练。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2278967393-e1787075432826.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:33:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/openai-says-it-paused-ai-training-for-two-weeks-and-announces-new-security-protocols-following-hugging-face-hack/</guid></item><item><title>国债接近40万亿美元，美国银行向债券投资者发出警告</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/with-the-national-debt-nearing-40-trillion-bank-of-america-has-a-warning-for-bond-investors/</link><description>美国银行策略师迈克尔·哈特尼特警告不要投资债券，因为美国继续存在巨额赤字。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2284535126-e1787078748605.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 19:12:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/with-the-national-debt-nearing-40-trillion-bank-of-america-has-a-warning-for-bond-investors/</guid></item><item><title>美国通过吸引世界上最优秀、最聪明的人才来打造自己的品牌。一定不能失去这个优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/us-built-brand-attracting-talent-must-not-lose-advantage-china/</link><description>正如任何首席执行官都知道的那样，最强大的品牌很少会被竞争对手摧毁。这一原则也适用于国家。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9-John-Quelch-e1786978290102.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/us-built-brand-attracting-talent-must-not-lose-advantage-china/</guid></item><item><title>David Sacks 表示 Anthropic 的 Dario Amodei 想要“AI 的 DMV”。尽管存在安全监管，许多行业仍蓬勃发展</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/david-sacks-says-anthropics-dario-amodei-wants-a-dmv-for-ai-but-plenty-of-industries-thrive-despite-safety-regulation/</link><description>在受到投资者 Gavin Baker 的批评后，Amodei 在社交媒体上为自己的监管方式以及对人工智能风险的讨论进行了辩护。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2280291366-1-e1787080684351.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 20:29:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/david-sacks-says-anthropics-dario-amodei-wants-a-dmv-for-ai-but-plenty-of-industries-thrive-despite-safety-regulation/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下悄悄资助加州财富税的风险投资和加密货币亿万富翁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/billionaires-california-wealth-tax/</link><description>竞选财务记录显示，至少有四位亿万富翁悄悄资助反对派，而且斗争只会越来越激烈&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2274637039-e1787078867868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:42:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/billionaires-california-wealth-tax/</guid></item><item><title>“人工智能教父”表示，埃隆·马斯克等亿万富翁对未来工作的看法是正确的，但他预测大规模失业即将到来</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/godfather-of-ai-geoffrey-hinton-massive-unemployment-warning-big-tech-replacing-workers/</link><description>尽管科技领袖们描绘了一个积极的未来，即由于人工智能，工作是可选的，但“人工智能教父”杰弗里·辛顿警告说，他们“押注人工智能会取代大量工人”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GettyImages-1260047116-e1764863526884.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 13:19:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/godfather-of-ai-geoffrey-hinton-massive-unemployment-warning-big-tech-replacing-workers/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 与 Nvidia 的数据中心交易金额比报道的低 1450 亿美元，这表明人们对芯片需求的人为需求的担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/openai-data-center-deal-with-nvidia-comes-in-145-billion-lower-than-reportedsignaling-concerns-of-artificial-demand-for-chips/</link><description>循环融资的担忧围绕着这家芯片制造商对 OpenAI 数据中心租赁的投资。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2285784039-e1787072691557.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 17:08:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/openai-data-center-deal-with-nvidia-comes-in-145-billion-lower-than-reportedsignaling-concerns-of-artificial-demand-for-chips/</guid></item></channel></rss>